{"reviews":[{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-0","r":5.0,"t":"The best makeup bag I\u2019ve ever had","x":"I haven\u2019t dunked this is water but boy I love these. They aren\u2019t really clear so if your using it for concerts that require a clear bag this isn\u2019t for you. (But I don\u2019t need clear) THIS IS PERFECT. They are amazing for the price and the perfect sizes I\u2019ve never had a bag that fits all my \u201cnatural look\u201d makeup in it. Perfectly gorgeous and it\u2019s just clear enough to know what\u2019s inside of it without people knowing everything. You can see shapes but not labels. I love them and if I ever need another","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"Exactly as pictures. Very soft and pretty. The pouches are not hard if your looking for that solid feel. They are light weight and thin. It works for me and great price. Def recommend","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous makeup bags!!","x":"Appears just as the advertisement! One for me and one for my daughter! Very beautiful \ud83d\udc95","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Cute & handy","x":"I love these bags. I use the large one for pens/highlighter for my planner, and I use the smaller one for the makeup I take with me for touch ups on a daily basis. The zipper is hefty and doesn\u2019t give me issues when I cram a bunch of stuff in the bag.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome, very pretty.","x":"Awesome little pouches. You can use them in so many ways. I use them for my tarot supplies, but I can see them being used for school supplies, makeup, & more! Very pretty!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-5","r":4.0,"t":"Purchased to customize with my logo","x":"Zipper is quality. Material looks so cool. Great for gifts and boutiques.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Sleek and smooth zip","x":"These pouches are so cute and the make is pretty good and sturdy. The most important thing is that they look really sleek and don't get as much fingerprints on as I though they would. Also their zip is really smooth.  Approve wholeheartedly","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous and sturdy","x":"Love love love- I\u2019m using these as pencil bags","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great for purses","x":"I bought these because I switch purses often so I needed something to keep my \u201cpurse essentials\u201d lol to just transfer from purse to purse and make it easy. It is a bit see through so that\u2019s perfect so I don\u2019t have to dig through it when I\u2019m looking for something. It is enough see-through for only you to be able to see what\u2019s in it not someone next to you sorta like a black privacy glass on protector on a phone due to hologram. I keep my lipgloss, mirror, wet wipes , hair ties for my kids .. etc ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and sturdy","x":"Bought these based off of the other positive reviews and was not disappointed! Beautiful and sturdy. I use the big one for my manicure supplies and the small one as a make-up bag. A lot of my purses have compartments that are open on the top, so I'm glad that this looks cute even hanging out of a stuffed purse! I love that you can kind of see through them (makes searching for something at the bottom easy) but that they're not totally clear,  the iridescence and pretty colors kind of mask the clu","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-10","r":4.0,"t":"Cute and durable!","x":"These are super cute and don\u2019t look or feel cheaply made. My only complaint is that we\u2019re smaller than expected!  Update: I have been using these for the last month and I love you can see inside of makeup bag but the color help to disguise your products! The zippers are great!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great pandemic cases","x":"Pleasantly surprised at how nice these were. I bought them bc I want things organized in nice cases in my new clear vinyl purse I bought bc I was tired of ruining by leather bags.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for me -- opaque but sufficiently transparent up close.","x":"Exactly what I wanted.  Two sizes provide great flexibility, and the opaqueness conceals from a distance, but closer, allows sufficient transparency to view the items within.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"10...10...10'zzzz across the board.","x":"Not cheap looking....Actually an expensive ora about it....held together nicely,  not flimsy.  Very pleased.  The small bag and the large..very roomy!!! A great buy","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great item!","x":"These are beautiful!! I am a nail technician and I use these as portable storage for all of my brushes and nail art items I use. Beautiful way to organize my items.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"Great for traveling/moving! They are smallish of course but that\u2019s what I needed. I wanted something to have my faves in for travel. I love the waterproof aspect!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Cute Make Up Bag","x":"Like this make up bag. Comes with a large one and smaller one inside. Packaged nicely. I embellished with a rhinestone sticker to personalize as a gift.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and useful.","x":"These are cute and feel pretty sturdy. I like the 2 sizes, one for makeup, the other for a pencil case. I also like that you can kinda see through them.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Fun gift!","x":"Quality of zipper is really good and it is sturdy. Must be careful with the surface. Overall happy with this purchase. Would recommend purchasing.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality","x":"Great bags , cute, you can fit a regular size brush and a regular size body spray bottle on the bigger bag , sturdy good quality worth the money .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-20","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE!!!","x":"why don't they have a tote to go with this cute pouches!!!!!???? Uugh. I would recommend totally!!!!!! Seems durable, waterproof and chic!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-21","r":3.0,"t":"Good for the price.","x":"Super cute color?! Just as pictured. Only thing feels a bit cheap not sure how long it will last. But for the price it's ok.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great value for 2 bags!!","x":"I love that these matched (Exactly) a tote bag I already had, and I could use them together. Great bags for traveling!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-23","r":5.0,"t":"arrived like in two days.","x":"I use this product  4 my make up. loved that it came with  two sizes. see thru to find things better. made well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B082SYK6WQ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Good buy","x":"Bought this for my niece. She like them a lot. Easy for traveling and putting on her dresser to keep it clean.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the pouches as beautiful, cute, and pretty.","cites":[2,3,4,5,7,10,11,15]},{"text":"Many praise the sturdy, quality construction and smooth, hefty zippers.","cites":[4,6,7,8,10,11,14]},{"text":"Customers value the two sizes and versatility for organizing makeup, supplies, and purse essentials.","cites":[4,5,9,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several note the material is thin, lightweight, and not hard or solid.","cites":[2,11,14]},{"text":"A few mention the bags are smaller than expected or not truly clear.","cites":[1,11]}]},"qa":[]}